OL,3,ATrump, Xi and Putin set to hold
OL,4,Ahistoric meeting on Apec sidelines
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump has met
OL,7,FRussian President Vladimir Putin on the
OL,8,Fsidelines of the Asia-Pacific Economic
OL,9,FCo-operation (Apec) summit in the
OL,10,Fsouthern Chinese city of Shenzhen,
OL,11,Fsaying ahead of the meeting that
OL,12,F"wonderful things can come out of this"
OL,14,FEarlier, Trump told US media that he
OL,15,F"briefly" spoke to Xi Jinping about
OL,16,FNvidia CEO Jensen Huang, calling his
OL,17,Fremoval from the company a "real
OL,18,Ftragedy" - Huang admitted to an affair
OL,19,Fwith a woman who is accused of being an
OL,20,Fasset for China
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
